    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-26-082: Winchester Blvd Apartments, located at 1390 South Winchester Boulevard and 3071, 3075 Driftwood Drive in San Jose, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $2,800,000 in annual federal tax credits and $7,179,385 in total state tax credits to finance the new construction of 85 units of housing serving special needs tenants with rents affordable to households earning 30%-60% of area median income (AMI).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001673"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City of San Jose permit MP23-004 (Ministerial Permit, folder year 2023), status Approved, issue date 2024-07-18: \"SB 35 Ministerial Permit (MP23-004) to allow the demolition of three commercial buildings totaling approximately 15,630 square feet and associated surface parking lots and paved surfaces, and construction of a 5-story 100 percent affordable housing proj\" (city text cut off at 255 characters)",
