    {
      "text": "Listing quoting permit MP23-004: demolition of three commercial buildings of about 15,630 sq ft and construction of a 5-story, 100 percent affordable project with 101 rental units including 2 manager units; removal of 10 trees; 7 State Density Bonus waivers and 1 concession; 1.11 gross acres.",
